Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.29,0:00:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.67,0:00:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,龙斗  早上啰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.93,0:00:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,白河同学的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.48,0:00:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,龙斗  你要睡到什么时候啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.94,0:00:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.28,0:00:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,早…早安
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.65,0:00:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,原来不是梦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.87,0:00:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这个夏天  我和白河同学
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.99,0:00:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,将在同一个屋檐下度过
Comment: 0,0:00:39.87,0:00:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Love You
Comment: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:00:57.31,0:01:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,咦? 总觉得我好奇怪
Comment: 0,0:01:00.77,0:01:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没有过 这样的感觉
Comment: 0,0:01:03.27,0:01:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,每当感受到你的温柔 为什么呢?
Comment: 0,0:01:06.61,0:01:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我的胸口就会感到难受
Comment: 0,0:01:10.45,0:01:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,相互交叠
Comment: 0,0:01:11.95,0:01:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,逐渐混合
Comment: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,已经无论如何都无法停止了(无法!)
Comment: 0,0:01:16.53,0:01:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,被烟火的光线给照亮的
Comment: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你的侧脸
Comment: 0,0:01:24.71,0:01:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,LaLaLa
Comment: 0,0:01:25.21,0:01:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Love You
Comment: 0,0:01:26.54,0:01:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:01:28.55,0:01:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,人家正盯着你呢
Comment: 0,0:01:30.97,0:01:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌暧昧 待在我身边
Comment: 0,0:01:33.97,0:01:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,(一直一直 待在我身边)
Comment: 0,0:01:36.51,0:01:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,LaLaLa
Comment: 0,0:01:37.06,0:01:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Love You
Comment: 0,0:01:38.39,0:01:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:01:40.14,0:01:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是恋爱吧
Comment: 0,0:01:42.64,0:01:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是你让我了解这感觉的
Comment: 0,0:01:45.65,0:01:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,(这是你带给我的感觉)
Comment: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,对象是我真的可以吗?
Comment: 0,0:01:50.07,0:01:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,(对象是我真的可以吗?)
Comment: 0,0:01:51.49,0:01:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知所措又无法更进一步 真是的…
Comment: 0,0:01:54.32,0:01:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,忐忑不安又闪闪发光的现在
Comment: 0,0:01:57.33,0:02:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,逐渐染上可爱色彩的世界
Comment: 0,0:02:00.33,0:02:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:02:08.98,0:02:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,(没经验的我和有经验的你)\N(去参加夏日祭典的故事)
